id: pm-kmwdpa
title: Configure generated identity defaults and explicit override policy across SDK transports
description: Implement GitHub issue1442 through discoverable project configuration and shared SDK creation policy. Ordinary new work consumes the generated create receipt; deliberate import and integration identities remain explicit. Evaluate selective migration through pm-kl19 without applying any real tracker migration.
type: Feature
status: open
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-11T15:40:59.944Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-11T18:05:17.229Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 480
acceptance_criteria: Configuration-driven effective identity policy is consistent across CLI SDK MCP and extensions; default creates return generated IDs and preserved receipt identities; intentional override/import behavior has explicit compatibility and provenance; invalid settings and refused overrides preserve bytes and have recovery; migration is dry-run-first and preserves historical identities through the canonical migration owner.
parent: pm-o2kc
risk: high
confidence: medium
expected_result: "Ordinary work uses generated identities while deliberate overrides remain governed and discoverable, and migration preserves recorded history and references."
